{
  "projects": {
    "default": "demo-naija-parts-hub"
  },
  "//": [
    "The `demo-` prefix is meaningful, not cosmetic: the Firebase Emulator",
    "Suite treats any demo-* project id as offline-only. No credentials are",
    "required, and no call can ever reach a real Firebase project by accident.",
    "",
    "When the client's live project exists, add it as a named alias rather than",
    "replacing this one:",
    "  firebase use --add    # -> aliases 'prod' to the real project id",
    "so local development keeps running against demo-* with no code changes."
  ]
}
